<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="mt">Yona</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Yona cholonga viya Yona viyatumigwe kuna dibululu da Ninawi. Mbasakanyo na vitabu vimwenga va ulotezi, chitabu chino chosonhela ng'hani mulotezi na sang'hano zake kufosa usenga wa Mulungu. Sang'hano ya Yona ilawilila lusita Yeloboamu wekaidi viyakalile mfalume wa Isilaili muna umwaka wa 800-750 KK. Mbali wasomi hawavimanyile chitabu chino chandikigwa zuwaki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulungu kamtuma Yona kupeta kwa Waninawi, mbali Yona hamtegeleze na kalamula kuhita bululu dimwenga yambange Mndewa Mulungu, sula 1:1-3. Kahita kuna imeli ikalile yohita kuna dibululu da Talishishi. Lusita meli viikalile muumwanza kuhita Talishishi, Mulungu kagala beho kulu. Wasang'hani wa meli wadumba ng'hani. Ivo wamwasa Yona mwiibahali muladi kuhoza ludoko lwa Mulungu. Maabaho Mulungu katuma somba mkulu yammele Yona. Yona kampula Mulungu na Mulungu kamuleka yawe mgima. Hamwande Yona kahita Ninawi kupeta mbuli ya Mulungu na wanhu wa bululu da Ninawi wasama uhasanyi wawo. Chitabu cha Yona cholonga viya Mulungu viyeli na ubazi, mbali Yona halondile Mulungu yawe na ubazi sula 4:2.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya mwanduso yolonga viya Yona viyamkimbile Mulungu na kuhelela muna umunda wa somba.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula yekaidi ina mbuli Yona ziyampulile Mulungu lusita viyakalile muna umunda wa somba.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula yeketatu Yona kapetela wanhu wa bululu da Ninawi wasame. Mulungu kasagula kuwalekelela.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kuuhelelo, muna isula yekane, Yona kapata ludoko kwaviya Mulungu kowawonela ubazi wanhu wa Ninawi na komulongela Yona kuwa kowalonda wanhu wose.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Yona kogeza kumbanga Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Yona mwana wa Amitai, ilonga, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“Segela uhite kuna dibululu da Ninawi dili kulu ng'hani. Uko ukawagong'ondele nhaguso wanhu wake, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kauwona wihi wawo!”<verse eid="JON 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Mbali Yona kalema, kakimbilila Talishishi muladi sekeyatende viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Kahita Yafa na kawona meli yohita Talishishi. Ivo kaliha nauli na kakwela meli iyo. Kahita hamwe nayo Talishishi muladi yambange Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu katuma beho kulu muna ibahali, meli isung'higwa mbaka ilonda kubeneka. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Baho wasang'hani wa meli wadumba ng'hani. Ivo wose wailamba milungu yawo. Wasa mbahasha zawo zose muna ibahali muladi kuhunguza nzamo muna imeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:5">Mbali Yona kakala kagona muna imeli. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Mwendeshaji meli kamuhitila Yona na kamuuza, “Habali kogona? Lamuka umpule Mulungu wako. Yodahika kezachiwonela ubazi sekechidanganike.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Maabaho wasang'hani waitogololela, “Chitowe mhiya muladi chivimanye habali mbuli ino ichipata?” Ivo watowa mhiya na imulagalila Yona.<verse eid="JON 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Ivo wamuuza, “Weye kutenda choni mbaka chipatigwa na mbuli ino? Weye sang'hano yako ilihi? Weye kulawa kulihi? Kulawa isi yaki? Weye munhu wa kabila jaki?”<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Nayo kawedika, “Niye Muebulaniya na nomtambikila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa kuulanga, yalumbile bahali na isi.” <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Yona kakala kowalongela kuwa kakala kombanga Mndewa Mulungu. Wanhu wawo viwahulike mbuli izo wadumba, wamulongela Yona, “Habali kutenda ivo?”<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Maabaho wamulongela, “Cheye chikutende choni muladi bahali ihupike?” Kwaviya bahali ikala yokongezeka kutibuka. <verse eid="JON 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Yona kawedika, “Nisoleni munyase muna ibahali, maabaho bahali izahupika. Novimanya kuwa niye niicho ichimu cha mweye kupatigwa na mbuli ino.”<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Wasang'hani waiyoha kutowa ng'hafi muladi wadahe kubwela kuna iisi, mbali wapotigwa kwaviya bahali iiyoha kutibuka. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Ivo wampula Mndewa Mulungu, walonga, “Sekeuchinange kwaviya chomkoma munhu ino, iviya sekeuchitaguse kwa kumkoma munhu yelibule ubananzi. Weye Mndewa Mulungu kutenda viulonda.” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Ivo wamsola Yona na wamwasa muna ibahali. Lusita ulo bahali ihupika. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Wanhu wawo wamdumba Mndewa Mulungu ng'hani na wandusa kulava nhambiko na kumulahila.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kasasala somba mkulu muna ibahali muladi yammele Yona. Yona kakala muna umunda wa somba siku nhatu, imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Yona kompula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Yona viyakalile muna umunda wa somba kampula Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wake, <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">“Vinikalile muna uuzidilwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">nikupula weye Mndewa Mulungu na kunidika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">Vinikalile kuzimu nikupula weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">na kunihulika dizi jangu.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Kwaviya kunyasa hana yamazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">hanhu hagidimile muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">mawimbi ya mazi yanizunguluka banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">na mazi mengi yafosa uchanyha yangu.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Niye nilonga, ‘Kuniwinga kutali sekeuniwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:4">mbali nizaiwona kaidi kaye yako yelile.’<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Mazi yanimemela mbaka yafika muna isingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">mawimbi yanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">na mayani ya bahali yanigubika ditwi jangu.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Nihulumuka mbaka hasi ya milima ili muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">uko mhalalingwe zihindigwa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu kunikombola kulawa umo muna dikombo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:6">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Vinikalile habehi kudanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">nikukumbuka weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">na mbuli zinipulile zikufikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">hana ikaye yako yelile.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Wanhu wotambikila nyang'hiti za milungu zili hazifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:8">wamuleka Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Mbali niye nizakulavila nhambiko ya kukwing'ha hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">Nizavifikiza vilaho vangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yokombola.”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Baho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela somba ija yamdeke Yona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:10">nayo kamdeka muna iisi.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Yona kohita Ninawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Maabaho mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Yona mwanza wekaidi, kulonga, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“Hita kuna dibululu kulu da Ninawi ukawagong'ondele usenga wondanikulagilize.”<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Ivo Yona kamtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu na kahita Ninawi fana viyalagilizigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 3:3">Bululu da Ninawi dikala kulu ng'hani. Yona kakala muna dibululu siku nhatu. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yona kandusa kugenda muna dibululu siku yose, kagong'onda, “Zisigala siku malongo mane muhala, bululu da Ninawi dizanangigwa.” <verse eid="JON 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Wanhu wa Ninawi wamuhuwila Mulungu, waitogolela kufunga kuja. Wanhu wose wakulu na wadodo waiyawala maguniya kulagusa kuwa wasama. <verse eid="JON 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Mfalume wa Ninawi viyahulike mbuli izo, kenuka hana ichigoda chake cha chifalume, kahambula koti jake na kaiyawala guniya, maabaho kakala muna yamaivu. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Maabaho kawalongela wanhu wa Ninawi mbuli izo, “Kwa lagilizo da mfalume na vinyandama wake, sekemuleke munhu yoyose hebu mnyama hebu ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo yalanze chinhu chochose. Sekemuwaleke waje hebu wang'we. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Wanhu wose na wanyama wolondeka wavale maguniya kulagusa wana usungu. Chila munhu kolondeka yamulambe Mulungu na yaleke kutenda ubozi na udugi. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Yodahika Mulungu kodaha kugalula magesa yake na kuchiwonela ubazi na kuleka ludoko lwake sekeyachinange.”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Mulungu viyawonile wanhu waleka kutenda mbuli zihile, kawawonela ubazi na hawanangile fana viyailungile.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">Yona kopata ludoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Mbali Yona hanogelwe na mbuli iyo na kapata ludoko ng'hani. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Ivo kampula Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nivimanya kwandusila umwaka kuwa hwizadinanga bululu da Ninawi. Lekamana nidileka bululu jangu na kuhita Talishishi. Weye Mulungu kuhola na kuna ubazi. Hupata ludoko himahima. Kolagusa ulondo mkulu wa kufunya umoyo na hulonda kuwananga wanhu. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Lelo, Mndewa Mulungu nokulamba unikome kwaviya muhavu nidanganike kufosa kuwa mgima.”<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Vino kogesa vinoga viuwona ludoko?”<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Yona kalawa muna dibululu, kahita kukala ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa bululu. Uko kazenga chizewe na kakala hana imbeho muladi yawone muna dibululu mwizalawilila choni. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu katenda lutanga lutambale lumpatile Yona mbeho, muladi lumuhunguzile Yona magayo. Yona kaludeng'helela ng'hani lutanga luja. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Mbali igolo yake imitondo, Mulungu kalagiliza sondo yaludafune lutanga ulo, nalo lunyala. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Zuwa vijalike, Mulungu kasasala beho da ulawilo wa zuwa dili na vuke ng'hani. Zuwa dimwakila Yona muna iditwi mbaka kakala habehi kusinduka. Kalonda kudanganika na kalonga, “Muhavu nidanganike kufosa kuwa mgima.”<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu komzuma Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Mulungu kamuuza Yona, “Vino kogesa vinoga kuwona ludoko kwa mbuli ija iulawilile lutanga luja?” Yona kedika, “Ona vinoga! Nina ludoko mbaka nowona muhavu nidanganike.”<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Yona, “Weye kuluwonela ubazi lutanga hulugaiye lotile. Lutanga ulwo lukangala kwa ichilo chimwe na kubanangigwa igolo yake. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Mbali bululu da Ninawi dina wanhu wengi hawadaha kuvimanya kwika goya mbuli zinogile na mbuli zihile. Iviya waumo ng'ombe wengi. Vino silondeke kudiwonela ubazi bululu ijo?”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>